- Preload critical assets when useful.
- Lazy-load noncritical components.
- Avoid excessive blur filters on mobile.
- Minimize layout shifts.
- Keep animations GPU-friendly where possible.

The cinematic background is the primary visual asset, so pay special attention to its loading performance.

Use a compressed version without visibly degrading the image.

